1419 0 obj
<<
/Title (The investors who saw it coming bought in 2022, 2023, 2024. They bought when EaDo was still a parking lot. When the Atlanta BeltLine was 30% complete. When Allapattah was still called "the next Wynwood" by people nobody listened to. By the time the tournament kicks off on June 11, the early money has already finished its first cycle.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1295 0 R
/Next 1488 0 R
>>
endobj
1420 0 obj
<<
/Title (The second window is the tournament itself. June 11 to July 19. Thirty-nine days. The money here is short-term: rental income, parking, hospitality, retail. It is real, it is significant, and it is mostly captured by people who already own the assets. A few specific plays remain available to new entrants in this window.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1295 0 R
/Prev 1489 0 R
>>
endobj
