/Title (What this pack is: a verified, sourced field guide to where the data is moving in the four cities most directly exposed to the FIFA World Cup 2026 catalyst. The numbers here are publicly available. The pattern they form is what most first-time investors will not connect until after it is too late to act on cheaply.)
