/Title (All data verified between September 2025 and May 2026 from the following sources: Real estate data: Redfin, Movoto, Zillow, NeighborhoodScout, AirDNA, Houston Properties Team, East Downtown Management District, Atlanta Beltline, Inc., Million Luxury, BLDUP. Financing: Freddie Mac PMMS \(April 30, 2026\), Bankrate, HomeAbroad, Defy Mortgage, Ridge Street Capital, Sistar Mortgage. Municipal authorities: City of Houston Administration & Regulatory Affairs Department \(Ordinance 2025-322\), City of Atlanta Department of City Planning \(Ordinance 20-O-1656\), City of Dallas Planning & Development Department, City of Miami \(Miami 21 zoning portal\), Miami-Dade County. Tournament data: FIFA, NYNJ FIFA World Cup 2026 host committee, MLSSoccer.com, Al Jazeera Sport, Colliers \("From Stadiums to Skylines" metro report\), Roadtrips, Atlanta Beltline World Cup 26 reporting. News and analysis: NBC 5 Dallas-Fort Worth, FOX 5 Atlanta, WFAA, Rough Draft Atlanta, Capital B News, Dallas Observer, Travel Noire, FIP Commercial, Buffalo Bayou Partnership, JMK Property Management, Atlanta Guide. Climate risk: First Street Foundation.)
